OL,3,GNEWSAGales and heavy rain to impact UK
OL,4,Aas yellow wind warning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weather system containing the
OL,7,Fremnants of Hurricane Isaias is
OL,8,Fforecast to send gales, heavy rain and
OL,9,Fa surge of warm air to parts of the UK
OL,10,Fthis week.
OL,12,FThe centre of the low, and its most
OL,13,Fsignificant impacts, will stay hundreds
OL,14,Fof miles from UK shores but north-west
OL,15,FScotland will see a spell of gales.
OL,17,FA Met Office yellow warning has been
OL,18,Fissued for parts of the Highlands and
OL,19,FWestern Isles with the risk of gusts
OL,20,Ftouching 70mph (113km/h) in places.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
