OL,3,GNEWSAGales and heavy rain to impact UK
OL,4,Aas yellow wind warning issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeavy rain will also affect parts of
OL,7,FScotland and Northern Ireland but much
OL,8,Fof England and Wales will remain
OL,9,Flargely dry with spells of sunshine.
